### Start batch transcription job
### Processes all audio files in input/swedish/ and input/english/ from S3
GET http://{{baseUrl}}/batch-transcribe
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Check batch transcription job status
### Replace jobId variable with the actual job ID returned from the start request
GET http://{{baseUrl}}/batch-transcribe/status?id={{jobId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
